* Award for the school. 13th Young Talent Competition for the BLUE DIAMOND Cup 2018. Theme: Comic – Pop Art Makeup;
* Award for the school. Young Talent Competition for the BLUE DIAMOND Cup 2023. Theme: Mysterious Elf;
* Award for the school. Young Talent Competition for the BLUE DIAMOND Cup 2024. Theme: Crazy Queen;
